<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17739" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fascĭcŭlus</span></b> , i,
			m.
		dim.
		fascis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a small bundle</i>, <i>packet</i>
			(class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">epistolarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Q. Fr. 2, 12, 4</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">so of packets of letters,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Att. 2, 13, 1</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">5, 11, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">12, 53</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">librorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 13, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fasciculum ad nares admovebis?</span>”
				<i>a bunch of flowers</i>, <i>nosegay</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Tusc. 3, 18, 43</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">linum in fasciculos manuales colligatum
					siccatur in sole,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 1, 3, § 16</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Matt. 13, 30</span></i>.</div>
